    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the sixth year, in the sixth month, on the fifth day of the month, as I sat in my house, with the elders of Judah sitting before me, the hand of the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " fell there upon me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I beheld, and lo, a form that had the appearance of a man;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "fire",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " below what appeared to be his loins it was fire, and above his loins it was like the appearance of brightness, like gleaming bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He put forth the form of a hand, and took me by a lock of my head; and the Spirit lifted me up between earth and heaven, and brought me in visions of God to Jerusalem, to the entrance of the gateway of the inner court that faces north, where was the seat of the image of jealousy, which provokes to jealousy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behold, the glory of the God of Israel was there, like the vision that I saw in the plain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said to me, “Son of man, lift up your eyes now in the direction of the north.” So I lifted up my eyes toward the north, and behold, north of the altar gate, in the entrance, was this image of jealousy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said to me, “Son of man, do you see what they are doing, the great abominations that the house of Israel are committing here, to drive me far from my sanctuary? But you will see still greater abominations.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he brought me to the door of the court; and when I looked, behold, there was a hole in the wall. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said he to me, “Son of man, dig in the wall”; and when I dug in the wall, lo, there was a door. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said to me, “Go in, and see the vile abominations that they are committing here.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went in and saw; and there, portrayed upon the wall round about, were all kinds of creeping things, and loathsome beasts, and all the idols of the house of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And before them stood seventy men of the elders of the house of Israel, with Ja-azaniah the son of Shaphan standing among them. Each had his censer in his hand, and the smoke of the cloud of incense went up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said to me, “Son of man, have you seen what the elders of the house of Israel are doing in the dark, every man in his room",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Vg Tg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "rooms",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of pictures? For they say, ‘The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " does not see us, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has forsaken the land.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said also to me, “You will see still greater abominations which they commit.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
